				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Typically feedback should be sought in the forums or IRC chatrooms, since pages that are slated for deletion do not retain their discussion comments after said deletion occurs. The <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/how-to-write-an-scp">How to Write an SCP</a> Guide has a section indicating how authors can seek reviews before a mainsite post.</p> 
				 	]]>
